{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"Rem =========================\nRem  ENKELT MASK-SPEL (AMOS)\nRem =========================\n\nScreen 640,480\n\nRem --- Musik, gjord i trackern ---\nTRACK LOAD \"Sound/Tracker/masken.amostrk\"\nTRACK PLAY\n\nRem --- Konstanter ---\ncellSize = 8\nmaxX = 640 / cellSize - 1\nmaxY = 480  / cellSize - 1\nscore = 0\nspeed = 5       Rem ju h\u00f6gre, desto l\u00e5ngsammare\ntick = 3\n\nRem --- Maskens start ---\nDim mx(400)\nDIM my(400)\nlength = 10\n\nFor i=0 To length\n  mx(i) = 10 - i\n  my(i) = 10\nNext i\n\nGosub NewFood\n\ndx = 1 : dy = 0\ncount = 0\nRem --- Huvudloop ---\nWhile 1\n  FOR I = 1 TO TICK\n    WAIT 10\n  NEXT\n\n  Rem --- Input ---\n  IF KEYSTATE(\"Left\") AND dx<>1 THEN LET dx=-1 : LET dy=0\n  IF KEYSTATE(\"Right\") AND dx<>-1 then dx=1 : dy=0\n  IF KEYSTATE(\"Up\") AND dy<>1 THEN dx=0 : dy=-1\n  IF KEYSTATE(\"Down\") AND dy<>-1 THEN dx=0 : dy=1\n\n  Rem --- Flytta kroppen ---\n  For i=length To 1 Step -1\n    mx(i)=mx(i-1)\n    my(i)=my(i-1)\n  Next i\n\n  Rem --- Flytta huvudet ---\n  mx(0)=mx(0)+dx\n  my(0)=my(0)+dy\n\n  Rem --- \u00c4ter mat ---\n  If mx(0) = fx And my(0) = fy\n    Inc score\n    Inc length\n    PLAY COIN\n    Gosub NewFood\n  EndIf\n\n  Rem --- Kollision med sig sj\u00e4lv ---\n  For i = 1 To length\n    If mx(0) = mx(i) And my(0) = my(i)\n      Exit While\n    EndIf\n  Next i\n\n  Rem --- Kollision med v\u00e4gg ---\n  If mx(0)<0 Or mx(0)>maxX Or my(0)<0 Or my(0)>maxY\n\tEXIT WHILE\n  ENDIF\n\n  CLSG 0\n  INKG RED\n  Box fx*cellSize, fy*cellSize, fx*cellSize+7, fy*cellSize+7\n  INKG WHITE\n\n  Rem --- Rita ---\n  For i=0 To length\n    Box mx(i)*cellSize, my(i)*cellSize, mx(i)*cellSize+7, my(i)*cellSize+7\n  Next i\n\n  INC COUNT\n  IF COUNT = 10 \n    IF lenth < 400 THEN INC length\n\tCOUNT = 0\n  ENDIF\n  \n  Locate 1,1\n  Print \"SCORE: \" & score\n\n  Wait Vbl\nWend\n\nRem --- Game Over ---\nPLAY EXPLOSION\nTRACK LOAD \"Sound/Tracker/gameover.amostrk\"\nTRACK LOOP 0\nTRACK PLAY\nLocate 10,10 : Print \"GAME OVER\"\nRem V\u00e4nta tills jingeln har spelat klart\nWhile TRACKPLAYING() = 1\n  Wait Vbl\nWend\nEnd\n\n\nNewFood:\n  Rem --- Slumpa ny mat ---\n  foodOk = 0\n  While foodOk = 0\n    fx = INT(Rnd(maxX))\n    fy = INT(Rnd(maxY))\n    foodOk = 1\n\n    Rem --- F\u00e5r inte ligga p\u00e5 masken ---\n    For i = 0 To length\n      If fx = mx(i) And fy = my(i)\n        foodOk = 0\n        Exit For\n      EndIf\n    Next i\n  Wend\nRETURN","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}